{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899440/extras/ezgif-6167b0b7d0eeb0.gif?t=1742751394\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>About this game</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Phoenix: The Fall </strong>is a multiplayer  FPS that combines intense combat with a tactical, team-based experience in a captivating near-future world. Immerse yourself in the harsh atmosphere of a raging conflict, where you'll navigate decaying urban landscapes and engage in battles for control of key objectives. Experience the full weight of war in a world where technology has spiraled out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899440/extras/ezgif-633261abb4a326.gif?t=1742751394\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Features</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense close-quarters combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tactical team-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visceral and immersive firefights</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Near-future city setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vertical urban environments </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Community-driven development</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Regular updates and improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique handcrafted gun sounds </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vast arsenal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple sides of the conflict </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1899440?t=1742751394","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1899440?t=1742751394","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/189944